WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Stress is a response to demands or
difficult circumstances. People respond

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
differently, and circumstances affect what
is possible.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
A next step might be practical help,
connection or a coping activity. You do

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
not have to choose the same option as
someone else.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Gentle breathing is optional. Follow
comfortable, unforced instructions if you

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
try it. Research does not establish a
guaranteed nervous-system reset.

7
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Persistent difficulties deserve
appropriate support. These illustrations

8
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
do not measure hormones, diagnose symptoms
or replace professional care.
